type: software
title: "sagf-root-repair: shoot-anchored geodesic forest decoding for root segmentation repair"
abstract: "Training-free shoot-anchored geodesic-forest repair of root segmentations, with unchanged frozen event-grouped evaluation, cross-objective results, independent complete-network algorithm verification and separately identified exploratory count, fixed-parameter, DRIVE comparator and point-matching analyses."
